---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Gaming — Jacob Sides"
	description="PC gaming, Counter-Strike, and clips from Jacob Sides."
	bodyClass="gaming-page"
>
	<main class="gaming">
		<a class="back" href="/">← jacobsides.com</a>
		<div class="gaming__grid">
			<header>
				<p class="eyebrow">Off the clock / Since 2004</p>
				<h1>PC gaming<br />is life<span>.</span></h1>
			</header>
			<div class="gaming__copy">
				<p class="lede">It started with a GameCube. The first PC showed up in 2011.</p>
				<p>
					In college, Counter-Strike scratched the itch for a competitive shooter I could keep
					improving at. For the next four years, I captained UTK’s CS:GO collegiate team and played
					at DreamHack Atlanta’s BYOC tournament.
				</p>
				<p>This is a home for clips, references, and whatever game has my attention next.</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<section class="clip">
			<div class="clip__meta">
				<p class="eyebrow">Field notes / CS2</p>
				<h2>Smoke lineups</h2>
				<p>Utility worth remembering, recorded for later.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="clip__video">
				<iframe
					src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/LBzuOB3C4TY?si=mWW-FK2vIfBgPOuz"
					title="CS2 smoke lineups"
					allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
					allowfullscreen
				></iframe>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	:global(.gaming-page) {
		background:
			linear-gradient(rgba(11, 11, 26, 0.93), rgba(11, 11, 26, 0.93)),
			repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 79px, rgba(157, 232, 237, 0.12) 80px);
	}

	.gaming {
		width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 0 8rem;
	}

	.back {
		color: var(--muted);
		font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.gaming__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
		align-items: end;
		gap: 5rem;
		min-height: 72vh;
		padding: 7rem 0;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--display);
		font-size: clamp(4.8rem, 11vw, 9rem);
		letter-spacing: -0.075em;
		line-height: 0.74;
	}

	h1 span {
		color: var(--cyan);
	}

	.gaming__copy {
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 1.08rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.gaming__copy .lede {
		color: var(--ink);
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		line-height: 1.2;
	}

	.clip {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 0.35fr 1fr;
		align-items: end;
		gap: 2rem;
		padding-top: 2rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
	}

	.clip h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--display);
		font-size: 2.5rem;
	}

	.clip__meta > p:last-child {
		color: var(--muted);
	}

	.clip__video {
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		background: #000;
	}

	iframe {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 800px) {
		.gaming__grid,
		.clip {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.gaming__grid {
			gap: 3rem;
		}
	}
</style>
